Name: playerError

Type: message

Syntax: playerError

Summary:
Sent when the content stops playing to due to an error.

Introduced: 4.6

OS: android

Platforms: mobile

Example:
on playerError
    answer "Stopped playing due to an error." with "Okay"
end playerError

Description:
Handle the <playerError> message when the content finishes playing as a
result of an error.

Use the <mobileControlGet> function to request more information about
the player properties.

References: mobileControlGet (function), playerFinished (message),
playerPropertyAvailable (message)

